{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月3日，據市場研究機構Counterpoint Research最新分析，大眾汽車正在實施一項全球技術戰略調整：一方面與恩智浦（NXP）合作推進全球統一電子電氣架構，另一方面在中國建立擁有更大自主權的本地技術體系。這意味着，大眾正在採取技術「雙軌制」，以應對全球市場規模化運營與中國市場快速迭代之間的不同需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584798.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.419939+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:59:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_hash":"42351282e4bc5f37219e6820587a55ccc5eee62a7f9d6d2f44c082d4756ad7f7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}